SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The cchhoowwnn() system call is expected to conform to ISO/IEC 9945-1:1990
     (“POSIX.1”).  The ffcchhoowwnnaatt() system call follows The Open Group Extended
     API Set 2 specification.

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The cchhoowwnn() function appeared in Version 1 AT&T UNIX.  The ffcchhoowwnn() sys‐
     tem call appeared in 4.2BSD.

     The cchhoowwnn() system call was changed to follow symbolic links in 4.4BSD.
     The llcchhoowwnn() system call was added in FreeBSD 3.0 to compensate for the
     loss of functionality.

     The ffcchhoowwnnaatt() system call appeared in FreeBSD 8.0.

